# hud deploy builds the upload context from .gitignore + .dockerignore (this file
# has higher priority). .gitignore excludes `data/`, but the Dockerfile needs
# data/graph.json (grader answer key) and data/cases.json COPYd into the image.
# Re-include the dir (so the context walk descends into it) and the two files.
# .env stays excluded by DEFAULT_EXCLUDES — secrets never enter the image.
!data
!data/graph.json
!data/cases.json
